WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.362
Open the Order List.

2
00:00:03.462 --> 00:00:07.736
Lines waiting for you are in the approval queue.

3
00:00:07.836 --> 00:00:13.336
Tap Approve.

4
00:00:14.406 --> 00:00:19.906
When you have placed the order, tap Mark ordered.

5
00:00:26.563 --> 00:00:30.440
The line moves to Ordered.
